<title>JAPAN: Dlr/yen steady in late Tokyo ahead of Greenspan.</title>
<headline>Dlr/yen steady in late Tokyo ahead of Greenspan.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>0625 GMT	    TRADED HIGH/LOW AS OF 0600 GMT</p>
<p> USD/JPY     116.12/17		116.39-116.05</p>
<p> USD/DEM     1.8005/10		1.8019-1.7953</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The dollar rose against the mark but hovered in a narrow range versus the yen in late Tokyo on Tuesday, as Tokyo players were sidelined ahead of Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan's Humphrey-Hawkins testimony.</p>
<p>There was talk that Asian central banks and U.S. players bought dollars against the mark and sold marks for the yen in late trade, a trader at a European bank said.</p>
